                            	  1296: AnimateDemoStoryFinalItems:
                            	  1297:     ; The demo story ending objects use special item types.
                            	  1298:     ; The bottom nibble of the item type is an index into two
                            	  1299:     ; tables. Each row has 6 bytes, one for each sprite of the
                            	  1300:     ; item type.
