                            	  6193: _L_z04_CheckBigDigdoggerCollisions_LoopCornerCollision:
                            	  6194:     ; Digdogger is big, but room boundary checks and
                            	  6195:     ; object collision checks assume a 16x16 monster or smaller.
                            	  6196:     ; Therefore, we have to check these things four times,
